---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-ink-900/10 bg-ink-950 text-ink-100">
  <div class="container-page flex flex-col gap-8 py-12 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between">
    <div class="max-w-md space-y-3">
      <p class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-cream">PookaAI</p>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-300">
        AI automation for local and SMB service businesses. Practical systems,
        plain English, no theater.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-2 text-sm">
      <a class="block text-cream transition hover:text-ember-300" href="mailto:hello@pookaai.com">hello@pookaai.com</a>
      <a class="block text-ink-300 transition hover:text-cream" href="https://pookaai.com">pookaai.com</a>
